I look at my second cup.
There is perfect foam on it.
This time I made the coffee well.
I proudly take the cup.
I carry the cup near the counter.
A woman is waiting in front of the counter.
She is our customer.
I give the cup to that woman.
I say, "Didi, please accept this."
The woman takes the cup.
She says, "Thank you."
When she smiles, I feel a lot of joy.
She drinks the coffee and is satisfied.
Earlier I did not make the first cup well.
But now the second cup is excellent.
I am learning to make good coffee.
Here in the café, I like this work.
Sunita also sees this.
She smiles with satisfaction seeing my work.
